  abstract = {Following the idea of [Far16], we develop the foundations of the geometric Langlands program on the Fargues--Fontaine curve. In particular, we define a category of \$\textbackslash ell\$-adic sheaves on the stack \$\textbackslash mathrm\textbraceleft Bun\textbraceright\_G\$ of \$G\$-bundles on the Fargues--Fontaine curve, prove a geometric Satake equivalence over the Fargues--Fontaine curve, and study the stack of \$L\$-parameters. As applications, we prove finiteness results for the cohomology of local Shimura varieties and general moduli spaces of local shtukas, and define \$L\$-parameters associated with irreducible smooth representations of \$G(E)\$, a map from the spectral Bernstein center to the Bernstein center, and the spectral action of the category of perfect complexes on the stack of \$L\$-parameters on the category of \$\textbackslash ell\$-adic sheaves on \$\textbackslash mathrm\textbraceleft Bun\textbraceright\_G\$.},
